			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783607415222,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Priority queues are widely used in algorithms such as Dijkstra’s shortest path algorithm, Prim’s\nminimum spanning tree algorithm, and Huffman coding for data compression.",
			"rawText": "Priority queues are widely used in algorithms such as Dijkstra’s shortest path algorithm, Prim’s minimum spanning tree algorithm, and Huffman coding for data compression.",
