			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783621270559,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Complexity for extractMin()\n- Time Complexity: O(log N) — The element moved to the root might be very large \n  and have to swap all the way down to the bottom level. \n  It travels the height of the tree, which is log N.\n- Space Complexity: O(1) — Again, strictly iteratively modifying array indices \n  in-place.",
			"rawText": "Complexity for extractMin()\n- Time Complexity: O(log N) — The element moved to the root might be very large \n  and have to swap all the way down to the bottom level. \n  It travels the height of the tree, which is log N.\n- Space Complexity: O(1) — Again, strictly iteratively modifying array indices \n  in-place.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "-nLVGz7iPqk094LF71V5f",
			"originalText": "Complexity for extractMin()\n- Time Complexity: O(log N) — The element moved to the root might be very large \n  and have to swap all the way down to the bottom level. \n  It travels the height of the tree, which is log N.\n- Space Complexity: O(1) — Again, strictly iteratively modifying array indices \n  in-place.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
