			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783621479844,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Crucial Exam Trap: Search complexity. \nA Heap is NOT a Binary Search Tree. There is no left/right ordering. \nIf you need to find a random number like 42 in a heap, you cannot use binary search\nlogic. \nYou have to check every single element (O(N)). Heaps are strictly built for finding\nthe absolute Min or Max, nothing else!",
			"rawText": "Crucial Exam Trap: Search complexity. \nA Heap is NOT a Binary Search Tree. There is no left/right ordering. \nIf you need to find a random number like 42 in a heap, you cannot use binary search logic. \nYou have to check every single element (O(N)). Heaps are strictly built for finding the absolute Min or Max, nothing else!",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "IVO8BMOB",
			"originalText": "Crucial Exam Trap: Search complexity. \nA Heap is NOT a Binary Search Tree. There is no left/right ordering. \nIf you need to find a random number like 42 in a heap, you cannot use binary search logic. \nYou have to check every single element (O(N)). Heaps are strictly built for finding the absolute Min or Max, nothing else!",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
